  ;; ── Row MOSFETs Q_R1..Q_R16 (AO3401A P-ch) ─────────────────────────────
  ;; Pattern for all 16 — shown symbolically; gate = ROW_SR_Rx via 100Ω gate R
  ;; Pull-up 10kΩ from gate to VHEAT (default OFF for P-ch)
  ;; Drain → ROW_x net → J2 pin

